text_output=We've added that to our roadmap, right? So that's something we've done intentionally to help drive the edge growth. And in physical AI, and look, the way to look at physical AI is the world of humanoids running around doing everything for us. I'm sure it will happen at some point in time. It ain't going to happen tomorrow.
